###
农历（the lunar calendar）起源于数千年前的中国，根据太阳和月亮的运行规律制定。长期以来，农历在农业生产和人们日常生活中发挥着重要作用。古人依据农历记录日期、安排农活，以便最有效地利用自然资源和气候条
件，提高农作物的产量和质量。中国的春节、中秋节等传统节日的日期都基于农历。农历是中国传统文化的重要组成部分，当今依然广为使用。

###
The lunar calendar originated in China before thousands of years, made by runing rotine of the sun and moon. For many years, the lunar calendar played an important role on
aggriculture and people's daily life. According to it, ancient people noted the time and planed planting to use natural resources and sky for improving the production and quality of
grain. A number of Chinese traditional festivals are based on it, including the Spring Festival and Mid-Autumn Festival. The lunar calendar is an integral part of Chinese traditional
culture, and it is used such at present.

###逐处错误标注
① which on the fifteen day：从句缺少谓语；fifteen 基数词错误；改为 **which falls on the 15th day**
② lunar eighth month：语序错误，固定为 **the eighth lunar month**
③ family numbers：单词拼写错误，members 才是家庭成员，改为 **family members**
④ featural food：featural 不是英语常用词，地道替换 **special food**
⑤ 指代歧义：最后一句 it 就近指代 mooncake，原文是**中秋节承载向往**，主语换成 **the festival**

###美化版本
The Mid-Autumn Festival is an integral traditional festival, which falls on the 15th day of the eighth lunar month. As a symbol of reunion, the moon is round and bright on this day.
When it comes, family members will get together to appreciate the moon and enjoy mooncakes. The mooncake is a special food of the Mid-Autumn Festival, with various flavors. For 
thousands of years, the festival carries people's longing for their relatives and embodies Chinese people's wishes for reunion.

###标准版
The Mid-Autumn Festival is an important traditional Chinese festival falling on the 15th day of the eighth lunar month. The round and bright moon stands for reunion. During the 
festival, family members get together to admire the moon and eat mooncakes. Mooncakes, in a wide range of flavors, are the signature food of the festival. For thousands of years, 
the festival has carried people's longing for their relatives and embodied Chinese people's wishes for reunion.
